Step-by-Step: Saving & Exiting nano
Once you have typed your variable, save the file using these keyboard shortcuts:

Press Ctrl + O (this triggers "Write Out" / Save).

Press Enter (to confirm keeping the filename /var/www/vurex-server/.env).

Press Ctrl + X (to exit nano and return to your normal SSH command line).

